/-
This file formalizes the main theorems from "The Harmonic Architecture of Primes".

It includes:
- The D₅ group action on rays.
- The Golden Ratio in pentagon geometry.
- The spiral embedding and its properties.
- Prime constellation structures (twin primes, quadruplets).
- The spectral reformulation of the Riemann Hypothesis.
- The Universal Dihedral Structure conjecture.
